{"id":"vod_bf_11040","vodId":"11040","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"攻壳机动队第一季","name_cn":"攻壳机动队第一季","date":"2002-01-01","year":"2002","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-12/43e28334ddfe2c7b4d6c929145dc95e6.jpg"},"summary":"《攻壳机动队》动画TV版，分2季。　　第一季描述：公元2030年，经历了4次世界大战的世界面临更严峻的挑战。随着人类义体化等科技的不断发展，犯罪行为也日渐离奇复杂。为了解决这类案件，日本内务省的直属部队——公安9课，这个对外不存在的特种部队，在队长草薙素子的带领下向恶势力 发起制裁。而面对公安9课的，是高度发达的科技下创造的案件、权力政治斗争的阴谋、与以笑脸男为代表的Stand Alone Complex犯罪。　　第二季故事发生在笑脸男事件结束后，公安9课面对了新的敌人，自称“个人的11人”的反政府武装组织开始了计划周密的犯罪，其背后牵扯的战争难民问题更令整个社会的矛盾激化。面对政府与犯罪分子带来的压力，草薙素子再次带领公安9课出动。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 19:50:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/gongkejidongduidiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://